    "actClause": "Concurrent Resolution of the Senate and Assembly proposing an amendment to subdivision 1 of section 9 of article 1 of the constitution, in relation to casino gambling in the state",
    "basePrintNo": "S5898",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5898-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
